      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛终盘中段时\\n速度稍微提升\\n习得的技能越多则效果越强",
      "source_fingerprint": "4b63877af93ed52be74cb787c19a020af76b9e76040c10182d0f17d300289c9e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "210282"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:934e3c9566210c367be98ae2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在最终直线处提升速度\\n合计获得的海外适性Lv越高\\n效果越好",
      "source_fingerprint": "fcfca47970de2360ccbf894defaaf5349fe34c5960cab33a74d03f2495ab966d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "210291"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7263ad6ddea03693540c021a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最终直线处稍微提升速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "b628d40a02c0d92377954a3ede75b3639cd7136e743ad793bc009ab5227557b3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "210292"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3faf42104ddda371715fdc61",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛中盘速度提升\\n并根据U.A.F.决胜大赛的优胜数提高效果\\n＜英里/中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "7da7ad119c70f888e5c34e56cbaf204cdb359a92eb6c0d20c8b26e527cdb8d80",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "210301"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5bbb698c674c48e76bb35fe9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛中盘速度稍微提升\\n＜英里/中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "3d316fb4a6a2445ccfc46fb0e4e1442a788f16b12281a7061707f99abc6dc7d6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "210302"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a48b0b719a8da6b5d1b92636",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛后半段稍微向前突进\\n若有十二分的毅力则变为小幅向前突进\\n＜英里/中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "d59ce62af3055ffdfe0749af70e8b7b72d7d373e1968cb2ee1c65d5bb8be7e05",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "210311"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:350b6580aa7b5000f4f49223",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最终冲刺时向前突进\\n获得的料理Pt总计越多\\n技能效果越好＜短距离/英里＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "5aa7009cb645ab00641b2b6e1750112f48909c9c27e3f69b34d7de01c98f8789",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "210321"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e6e7eff76c363078bc6c324b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最终冲刺时稍微向前突进\\n＜短距离/英里＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "54c83cd9fd3b41aa0ae765ace5bf9b07242babdf50157efe85a35799847328a9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "210322"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eb09f7cd41ca01057d8cf7f2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘稍微向前突进\\n如果力量有十二分强劲则变为小幅向前突进\\n＜短距离/英里＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "dbb032e8fea10bbb1751e10a79f6616eae3ef36bec5d6fa620fbbe59c58229df",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "210331"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0dd0a5be378cafa5f09fe84c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在最终直线上速度提升\\n所获得总研究Lv越高\\n技能效果越强＜中距离/长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "342cfddbe2b0cde661c4a0b7f2a7b8c5a16b7883d91245be13949248b1b89444",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "210341"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7df3049040bec2598cc0b956",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在最终直线上速度稍微提升\\n＜中距离/长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "d968d71ee7a272aeb95e121b726057855be67d8c7ed70abb1539754236255f5d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "210342"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49b7ee807735ab7c16087ced",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最终冲刺的关键时刻速度提升\\n根据粉丝数量提升技能效果",
      "source_fingerprint": "64449e3c25560c5021d1e2850398a84abbc1c1225f757565c59271f1b44e54a0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "210351"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:008b770ca755f31592082921",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最终冲刺的关键时刻速度稍微提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd8db31df1b46a28268e1976a875da9a38d6f74abf2e781887f7b14e5ffbbf03",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "210352"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b635edd2d29fb70a22492cb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在最终直线上速度提升\\n根据获得的总发展Pt提升技能效果\\n＜中距离/长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c4516e44899e2bed02c488c9c61eb7ce3f492a402b388275e2eff7fcdf19cc2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "210361"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1c2e88378941d2561eefcdde",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在最终直线速度稍微提升＜中距离/长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "db7c9bcef39fdb71e4d6250f5595581f52bb8e7195bb89eb5ef92b488ca4a307",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "210362"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f4f9c04f8639fbbf108cd1ed",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在最终冲刺期间速度会提升\\n若旅馆等级为传说旅馆则效果增加",
      "source_fingerprint": "e82b1efe7974060db593d757268de4457ee1ed8e16f39d199278fbdd25723dcf",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "210371"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:576c7683af078a6e04ad2bc9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在最终冲刺期间\\n速度会小幅提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "55842ddaf85ec831e14e9b683b494033316f91ff0e3513216d74a0f7ee049ba6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "210372"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3041799c0bdaacfc39f0113c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛最终盘的前段\n若正处于最后冲刺阶段则提升速度\n若队伍评价在S及以上则效果提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "0b3d4fbd50345d793a675ed901b532235311e7ed63bc9a5de261311f597d55ae",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "210381"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3365d13f7b7ffbc20cafacea",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛最终盘的前段\n若正处于最后冲刺阶段则\n速度稍微提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "94e910b37c51998588f36012fc92e9d158d15f13d03238d81992c185b9fc15b6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "210382"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ca986d1aef99df1608e1baa9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛最终阶段开始时\\n若处于最后冲刺中则提升速度\\n获得的总气氛Pt越高\\n则效果提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "ba176a750d6dc04483ae7f7311f7072daebf8e6ffacb12e17d5217cf51239ad3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "210391"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4927654fe48aa93a6f417f32",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛最终阶段开始时\\n若处于最后冲刺中\\n则速度稍微提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "88c2862566c07fadd58ba74624b42773c4f6dcc1988992805be822b02b846152",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "210392"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:afa692dded295c31e57b7437",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "对胜利的渴望正熊熊燃烧\\n使得能力值略微提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "d204f520cdcdd945dbde8ac6b52647906782ad105b4c6370c2e1d5d7b9f2d170",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "300011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:508e24a6118b27103e2c1f07",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "即便时过境迁,无法使用原先的跑法\\n但对胜利的渴望永不改变\\n使得能力值大幅提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "f5e688099e81845bf8da72b403f55b1a0d26b5eb541e4ccefd922e806e78361d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "300021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c26220ae38b3bb9c89d3b1ba",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "想要全力目睹梦中的景色\\n能力值略微提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "021d3c20b3514fccf0ca3f7cfd20f8d0f44091b00bafc64d3078396ba720f178",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "300031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ced23a81563773798dd61236",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "被训练员的不安所侵染\\n稍微难以发挥能力",
      "source_fingerprint": "4460037d2be7db0a21152241deb4356b8feb5b1b34e61c38e185ab0e5bbd4ed6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "300041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7333dce67f3eb80305b4c364",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "训练员的不安化为实体\\n在比赛后段的弯道上\\n速度极大量下降",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ddc3d5284c43a04508cca3c9246d977ac7cf043f5530a4b6202754de2bce33e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "300051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0656b0d57d260c239aa6c8f4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "承载着众人的心愿\\n想要率先冲线的愿望愈加强烈\\n在最终直线上速度提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ad9f774a04ef15dfae4cb2a4dd78087bf451eed93c84207fc823c91543a2975",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "300061"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b6f0476a14e03e00c2834d43",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "向无声铃鹿传达\\n看到全新舞台的期望\\n让她更好的发挥自己的能力",
      "source_fingerprint": "67f9a0276826f7866326c2dd8efcb345f50804acaeea8f4ec3af2cc58b51cbaf",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "300071"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6087a040a9468bf10d113ef6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "向无声铃鹿施下\\n能够畅快奔跑的魔咒\\n让她更好的发挥自己的能力",
      "source_fingerprint": "53d72ac81742037a6934fc2a7a7f7327693179139929bcb807fcb8e2333c1ba8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "300081"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0a4e6500ea3e1eab83500d68",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "无声铃鹿终于找到独属于自己的跑法\\n并将之化为对亲友的激励\\n无声铃鹿的能力能更好地发挥",
      "source_fingerprint": "38095beabdae8748731cbcb2410c40ccdfb3859d394868eab9daf3a214a24ae3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "300091"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9066308a208ef06e33b7aed7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛后段的弯道上\\n无声铃鹿感受到众人的祈愿\\n因此恢复耐力",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b60014a40b7b4b318d6489ee81e0c647648223980116d6a2856602a3250be50",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "300101"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:97fea3c7654876804c5e18dd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "朝着日本第一的赛马娘又近了一步\\n因此稍微更能发挥自己的实力",
      "source_fingerprint": "ce854ed7f8b339172d1b186358f43aa54f15b1309078b6304d9fed53cc485107",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "300111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eed20a3623d45a25a09c4a12",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这场比赛承载着队伍全员的心愿\\n对胜利的渴望正愈发强烈\\n因此极大幅提升能力值",
      "source_fingerprint": "f86b7d54dc8eee0f89f61565f1238ce70aacdc0500d7773a332f356957669b8a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "300121"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:73619f6b2f9f04e8e79de783",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "不遗余力,全力交锋！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e437460f05b6113a737bd1e1b5fb2ceafea654b5ec91ba57b447ea9350d007f2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "300131"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:81e4184a44ba68b9ab04d741",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "一决胜负,恕请赐教！",
      "source_fingerprint": "41814b8475e34bbd91951f96892977fa09ec601d02cd05f24e795eb0cce5b378",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "300141"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bf4523b7cb8c7abf16020e64",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "受到盒中的压抑影响\\n能力绝望性地难以发挥",
      "source_fingerprint": "d57873211e528bf9e690fd74387230b97a611267b438ab09dd4dd289aa622603",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "300151"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fced128669b6978ca0271b6b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "积极的心态变得模糊\\n比赛终盘加速度绝望性下降",
      "source_fingerprint": "e73ae3b5fe317d70fe447a6b84464f5f5333fe3424d12ac795f94ae2cc9cdf33",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "300161"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cf40d4d884ce318aeef8b5d1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "临近比赛中盘时\\n速度大幅提升＜英里/中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "3bc8e2bff8b9fe232257693525436e2e9fba12718aaf2073bb4e3b6e35abd80d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "407011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:84647a455167094855858707",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "中盘超越对手后\\n速度大幅提升＜英里/中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a7298ec71c2b427f6bef9d6e5df43c4e542965605f3997ba7a2fcefdf7a4042",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "407021"
      ]
    }
